- [Mobalytics Plus](https://mobalytics.gg/lol/glp/plus): Paid subscription available for LoL, TFT, PoE 2, and Diablo 4 — unlocks deeper stats, scouting, and advice; 7-day free trial; from $5.83–$7.99/mo. Games without a Plus subscription instead offer an ad-free plan that removes ads site-wide.
